# Puppet Server Complete Load
# EL9/SIMP 6.7 uses OpenVox, not Perforce Puppet. The package is
# 'openvox-server'; nothing in the EL9 repos Provides 'puppetserver',
# so asking for the old name aborts the install.
# (openvox-agent DOES Provide 'puppet-agent', so agent deps still resolve.)
lynx
git
openvox-server
simp
simp-adapter
# simp-vendored-r10k is REQUIRED, despite nothing declaring an RPM dependency
# on it: `simp config` deploys every Puppet module by shelling out to
# /usr/share/simp/bin/r10k (simp-cli, environment/puppet_dir_env.rb). Without
# it, `simp config` dies on that line and no module can be deployed.
# Built by build/el9-patches/vendored-r10k/build-el9.sh.
simp-vendored-r10k
xorriso
syslinux-tftpboot
yum-utils

